e eliminator fight with  makachev in february sees this as his  next fight before challenging for the  belt telling espn winner fights for the  belt i'm definitely happy with the  matchup i just want to fight the best  staying in the lightweight division tmz  sports caught up with michael chandler  to talk about a potential matchup  against conor mcgregor since joining the  ufc in 2021 michael chandler has become  one of the organization's most exciting  fighters with a fight of the year  performance against justin gaichi at ufc  268 and a knockout of the year contender  after his vicious front kick ko of tony  ferguson in may it's with good reason  chandler believes a bout between him and  mcgregor would be the best business for  the ufc if conor's coming back anytime  soon i think me and conor would make  some fireworks and it's a fight the fans  want to see i think it's the biggest  fight we can make in mixed martial arts  right now and i try to say that as  humble as possible but i think it's a  huge fight do you agree with michael  chandler let us know what you think of  chandler verse mcgregor in the comments  at the one championship amazon prime  press conference on wednesday night in  los angeles grappling specialist  danielle kelly took a shot at current  adam weight champion angela lee when  asked whether a grappling match with lee  was an option kelly responded  i wouldn't be opposed to it but i'm a  jujitsu person so i've been focused on  legit grapplers but if they want to give  me that match i'll take it in a  heartbeat lee wasn't granted an  opportunity to respond during the press  conference but thursday morning the  thick boy fight news team caught up with  her to hear her reaction on kelly's  comments and a potential shot at champ  champ status  honestly man this whole thing about  kelly and how she was at the press con  seen her over the past few days  she's just like a little bit so into  herself right and  i don't got time for that honestly like  i'm focused on the big fights right now  my title defense or moving up in weight  capturing that second belt and so  i think she's just trying to drag me and  pull me in and  get herself a big fight so i'm just  gonna  tune her out angela lee also told thick  boy fight news how being a new mother  has changed her motivation while  fighting  it's hard to explain but once you become  a mom  your whole purpose shifts and it's a  whole new motivation for doing things um  and  yeah i mean my daughter she's my pride  and joy and uh  i love what i do and i love that i'm  able to take her with me on this journey  thick boy fight news also spoke with  hall of famer and current vice president  of one championship rich franklin about  the streaming deal with prime video when  asked about the challenges and  opportunities the organization will face  breaking into north america rich was  confident the quality of product they  are offering will break through in this  competitive sports landscape you know i  think i think the biggest challenge  coming to the us is the fact that the  sports market here is so mature  so breaking through all the white noise  i i think the thing i'm most excited  about is the fact that one championship  unlike every other mma organization on  the planet we're not an mma organization  we're a martial arts organization so we  have  amazing kickboxing fights muay thai  fights grappling matches and you know  for example if you've seen our muay thai  matches these are done in the four ounce  gloves and it's  truly like some explosive stuff that'll  keep you on the edge of your seat i  think that when we deliver our product  that mixture of the all these different  disciplines along with the entertainment  value of the product that it's going to  be something that the american fans have  just not seen  ufc welterweight gilbert burns tweeted  that he will be prepared if one of nate  diaz or hamza chemayev has to withdraw  at ufc 279. welterweight bala muhammad  also sent out several tweets in support  of nate diaz after the bat with shimaya  was announced first tweeting let's go  nate  209 later responding to a fan suggesting  muhammad helps train diaz he tweeted hit  my line at nate diaz 209 we'll all  finish his string of tweets by mapping  his dream scenario for the welterweight  division i hope nate and leon both win  and ruin everyone's plans leon edwards  will challenge kamara usman for the  welterweight title at ufc 278.  looking for more original mma content  check out the rest of thick boy youtube  exclusive interviews opinion and fight  analysis is available weekly on the shob  show food truck diaries and fight night  flashbacks subscribe so you don't miss  any of the action  [Music]  you
 

